{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":497095,"name":"Jason","username":"stacker21","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/3d9bf3/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-21T15:29:21.739Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497095-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497095-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497095-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497095-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUser should be able to share only the vault of choosing, not the entire 1Password account.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497095-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497095-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnect 1Password in GrokBot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497095-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497095-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUser should be able to share only the vault of choosing, not the entire 1Password account.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497095-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497095-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/4/0/40a1b45a3cb727aca6ac79843a2c803140812245.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/9dL0wjrRL5GSKmXIvTBUmynepvv.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"image.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/4/0/40a1b45a3cb727aca6ac79843a2c803140812245_2_584x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"9dL0wjrRL5GSKmXIvTBUmynepvv\" width=\"584\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/4/0/40a1b45a3cb727aca6ac79843a2c803140812245_2_584x500.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/4/0/40a1b45a3cb727aca6ac79843a2c803140812245_2_876x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/4/0/40a1b45a3cb727aca6ac79843a2c803140812245_2_1168x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"E8E8E8\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1588×1358 177 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497095-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497095-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497095-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497095-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersion 0.57.1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497095-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497095-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSometimes - I can sometimes use Cursor\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-21T15:29:27.858Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":113,"reads":7,"readers_count":6,"score":471.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":172524,"topic_slug":"1password-vault-only-access-in-grokbot","display_username":"Jason","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":3,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":139023,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/1password-vault-only-access-in-grokbot/172524/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":true},{"id":497151,"name":"Colin","username":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-21T16:39:50.984Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/stacker21\"\u003e@stacker21\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for raising this, and good instinct to check.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe prompt you’re seeing is 1Password’s standard authorization for a one-time CLI session. Grok Bot uses that short session (it expires after about 10 minutes of inactivity or when 1Password locks) only to create a vault called “Shared with Grok Bot” and to mint a service account that can read just that vault. That service account is the only thing Grok Bot keeps. It has read-only access to that single vault, and you still approve each fill from your device.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo today the way to share only what you want is to move the specific logins into the “Shared with Grok Bot” vault. Anything you leave in your other vaults is never visible to Grok Bot.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-21T16:39:50.984Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":5,"reads":7,"readers_count":6,"score":21.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":172524,"topic_slug":"1password-vault-only-access-in-grokbot","display_username":"Colin","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Community Support Engineer","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":87436,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/1password-vault-only-access-in-grokbot/172524/4","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":499018,"name":"Jason","username":"stacker21","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/3d9bf3/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-23T11:22:26.743Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eGot it, thanks for clearing that up! I was able to get it working. I’d suggest making this clearer in the app, as the current prompt is a bit misleading about what it’s actually accessing. Thanks again!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-23T11:22:26.743Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":6,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":7